# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/fusion-2 window (the prefill levers on the ship stack: the prefill SDPA with one q chunk per core, WPP, and the 13x10 matmul grids, M1; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/fusion-2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job). Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-6 is the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (the oneq lever needs its binary; every arm without the flag runs that binary with the lever off). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# B0 (STOP): the window image tp4-fusion-6: the fusion pack's B0 (the image built from the pushed branch head with the PRODUCTION profile
# c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic baked as its serving default and a session cap of 8) plus C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ, so that the image's _ttnncpp.so is
# K64j plus the prefill factory's oneq edits (flag 0x8, inert unless QWEN_FAST_SDPA_PF_ONEQ=1) and QWEN_FAST_RUNTIME_BINARY_SHA256 is its digest. Every other arm of the
# window runs that binary with the lever off. THE IMAGE IS A GATE-WINDOW IMAGE ONLY: packed_any_admission accepts the K64j-OQ binary in a gate boot (QWEN_C2_GATE=1) on the
# K64j evidence records, and in a traffic boot only on records made on K64j-OQ (fusion-wp/WPP.json notes: the requalification list), so this image must not be deployed to
# production. It carries every package's modules (the overlay manifest, which make_fusion_profiles.py fills from the manifests: grid13_tp.py and sdpa_pf_oneq_tp.py among
# them) and tp_addresses.install wires both levers. READ: 'baking the serving default c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic with a session cap of 8', the
# provenance report with no problem line and its K64j-OQ graft line, the image id. A build, not a card job: it may run while the cards serve, never during a timing job.
# Duration (estimate): 40 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=build
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-6
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4
C2_BAKE_DEFAULT_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic
C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ
